{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16690","headline":"题服柏先生 · 于鹄","name":"题服柏先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"服柏不飞链，闲眠闭草堂。\n有泉唯盥漱，留火爲焚香。\n新雨闲门静，孤松满院凉。\n仍闻枕中术，曾授汉淮王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}